  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The roof extension, owing to its size, design and positioning is an intrusive development and adversely affects the character and appearance of the property and Conservation Area. The development is therefore considered contrary to policies ENV 1.1, ENV 1.2 & H 3.4 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan and policies ENV-B.1.1, ENV-B.2.2 & H.6.4 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan Revised Deposit.\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The roof extension, by reason of its size and positioning, increases overlooking and reduces privacy of adjacent properties.  The development adversely affects residential amenities and is therefore considered contrary to policies ENV 1.1 & H 3.4 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan and policies ENV-B.1.1 & H.6.4 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan Revised Deposit.\r\n\r\n"
